{
    "lootplot.targets": {
        "When a slot is {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Rerolled,": "\u5f53\u4e00\u4e2a\u69fd\u88ab{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c",
        "When an item is {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulsed,": "\u5f53\u4e00\u4e2a\u7269\u54c1\u88ab{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u89e6\u53d1\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c",
        "When a target item is {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulsed,": "\u5f53\u76ee\u6807\u7269\u54c1\u88ab{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c",
        "When a target slot is {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Rerolled,": "\u5f53\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u88ab{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c",
        "When a target slot is {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulsed,": "\"\u5f53\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u88ab{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2\u65f6,\""
    },
    "lootplot.main": {
        "This is the {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}PULSE{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} Button.\nIt will trigger {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}PULSE{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} on these eggs!": "\u8fd9\u662f{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u6309\u94ae\u3002  \n\u5b83\u4f1a\u5728\u8fd9\u4e9b\u86cb\u4e0a\u89e6\u53d1{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\uff01"
    },
    "lootplot.s0.content": {
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Normal Slot": "\u201c{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u6362\u4e3a\u666e\u901a\u69fd\u201d",
        "Converts target slot into {/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}DOOMED-20{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR} Reroll Slot": "\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u5316\u4e3a{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a-20{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7\u69fd",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Null Slot": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u6362\u4e3aNull\u69fd\"",
        "Spawns a {c r=1 b=0.2 g=0.3}Ruby{/c} {lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}STUCKY{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR} Slot": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{c r=1 b=0.2 g=0.3}\u7ea2\u5b9d\u77f3{/c}{lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}\u80ae\u810f{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}\u69fd",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Spawn a RARE item in an ABOVE shape that has only 1 use.": "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a\u7a00\u6709\u7269\u54c1\uff0c\u5176\u5f62\u72b6\u4e3aABOVE\uff0c\u4ec5\u53ef\u4f7f\u75281\u6b21\u3002",
        "Permanently gains {lootplot:POINTS_MOD_COLOR}+4 Points-Generated": "\u6c38\u4e45\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_MOD_COLOR}+4\u70b9\u6570\u751f\u6210",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Shuffle traits between target items": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5728\u76ee\u6807\u7269\u54c1\u95f4\u6d17\u724c\u7279\u8d28\"",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Reroll Slot": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u5316\u4e3a\u91cd\u63b7\u69fd\"",
        "Gives {lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}DOOMED-10{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR} to target item/slot,But also double it's points.\n(Doesn't work on {lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}DOOMED{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR} items!)": "\u7ed9\u4e88\u76ee\u6807\u7269\u54c1/\u69fd{lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a-10{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\uff0c\u4f46\u540c\u65f6\u4f7f\u5176\u70b9\u6570\u7ffb\u500d\u3002\uff08\u4e0d\u9002\u7528\u4e8e{lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR}\u7269\u54c1\uff01\uff09",
        "Permanently gains {lootplot:POINTS_MOD_COLOR}+6 Points-Generated": "\u6c38\u4e45\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_MOD_COLOR}+6\u70b9\u6570\u751f\u6210",
        "When 3 are in a line:\nSpawns a {lootplot:INFO_COLOR}Cloud Food Item": "\u5f533\u4e2a\u8fde\u6210\u4e00\u7ebf\u65f6\uff1a \u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\u4e91\u7aef\u98df\u7269\u7269\u54c1{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}",
        "Spawns a {lootplot:INFO_COLOR}STEEL-SLOT{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}, and a {lootplot:INFO_COLOR}FLOATY-KEY{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}!": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\u94a2\u69fd{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\uff0c\u548c\u4e00\u4e2a{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\u6d6e\u7a7a\u94a5\u5319{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\uff01",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Rerolls target slot or item.": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u6216\u7269\u54c1\u3002\"",
        "When Rerolled, gain {lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+0.2 mult": "\u91cd\u63b7\u65f6\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+0.2\u500d\u7387{/lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}",
        "Earn {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} of interest for every {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$10{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} you have. (Max of $20)\n{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}(Balance: $%{balance}){/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}": "\u6bcf\u6301\u6709{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$10{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u53ef\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u5229\u606f\u3002\uff08\u6700\u591a$20\uff09  \n{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\uff08\u4f59\u989d\uff1a$%{balance}\uff09{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}",
        "Triggers {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}REROLL for slot.": "\u89e6\u53d1\u69fd\u7684{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7\u3002",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Increase item price by 20%": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u7269\u54c1\u4ef7\u683c\u63d0\u9ad820%\"",
        "When rotated, gain {lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+5 points": "\u65cb\u8f6c\u65f6\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+5\u70b9\u6570{/lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}",
        "Can hold {c r=0 g=1 b=0}{wavy}plant{/wavy}{/c} items. Cannot hold RARE items.": "\u53ef\u4ee5\u6301\u6709{c r=0 g=1 b=0}{wavy}\u690d\u7269{/wavy}{/c}\u7269\u54c1\u3002\u4e0d\u80fd\u6301\u6709\u7a00\u6709\u7269\u54c1\u3002",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Set item's shape to KNIGHT.": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u7269\u54c1\u7684\u5f62\u72b6\u8bbe\u4e3aL\u5f62\u3002\"",
        "Converts target slot into {wavy amp=2}{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}???{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}{/wavy}": "\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u6362\u4e3a{wavy amp=2}{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}???{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}{/wavy}",
        "Earn {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} of interest for every {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$10{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} you have. (Max of {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR})": "\u6bcf\u6709{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$10{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\uff0c\u8d5a\u53d6{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u5229\u606f\u3002\uff08\u6700\u591a{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\uff09",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Dirt Slot": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u5316\u4e3a\u6ce5\u571f\u69fd{/lootplot.targets:COLOR}\"",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Shop Slot": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u6362\u4e3a\u5546\u5e97\u69fd{/lootplot.targets:COLOR}\"",
        "Permanently buffs item/slots multiplier by {lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+1": "\u6c38\u4e45\u589e\u5f3a\u7269\u54c1/\u69fd\u500d\u7387{lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+1",
        "Spawns a %{RARE} item, and adds {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Reroll{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} trigger to it.": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a%{RARE}\u7269\u54c1\uff0c\u5e76\u4e3a\u5176\u6dfb\u52a0{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u89e6\u53d1\u3002",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Trigger REROLL for item.": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u89e6\u53d1\u7269\u54c1\u91cd\u63b7\u3002\"",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Earn points for every target item.": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u6bcf\u4e2a\u76ee\u6807\u7269\u54c1\u5747\u53ef\u83b7\u5f97\u70b9\u6570\u3002\"",
        "{lootplot.targets:COLOR}Converts target slot into Sell Slot": "\"{lootplot.targets:COLOR}\u5c06\u76ee\u6807\u69fd\u8f6c\u6362\u4e3a\u51fa\u552e\u69fd\""
    },
    "lootplot.s0": {
        "This is the {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}PULSE{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} Button.\nIt will trigger {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}PULSE{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} on these eggs!": "\u8fd9\u662f{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u6309\u94ae\u3002  \n\u5b83\u4f1a\u5728\u8fd9\u4e9b\u86cb\u4e0a\u89e6\u53d1{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\uff01",
        "{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}Bonus{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR} will earn extra points.\n({lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}Bonus{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR} is reset to 0 after the {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulse{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR})": "{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u52a0\u6210{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u5c06\u83b7\u5f97\u989d\u5916\u70b9\u6570\u3002 \uff08{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u52a0\u6210{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u5c06\u5728{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u540e\u91cd\u7f6e\u4e3a0\uff09",
        "Spawns a {c r=1 b=0.2 g=0.3}Ruby{/c} {lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}STUCKY{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR} Slot": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{c r=1 b=0.2 g=0.3}\u7ea2\u5b9d\u77f3{/c}{lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}STUCKY{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}\u69fd",
        "20% chance to replace {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulse{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} trigger with {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Level-Up{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} on the closest item.": "\u5bf9\u6700\u8fd1\u7684\u7269\u54c1\u670920%\u7684\u51e0\u7387\u5c06{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u89e6\u53d1\u66ff\u6362\u4e3a{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u5347\u7ea7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u3002",
        "If purchased item price is more than {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$3,\nEarn $1": "\u5982\u679c\u5df2\u8d2d\u4e70\u7269\u54c1\u4ef7\u683c\u8d85\u8fc7{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$3\uff0c\u8d5a\u53d6$1",
        "Randomizes item prices between {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$0{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} and {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$15{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}": "\u968f\u673a\u8c03\u6574\u7269\u54c1\u4ef7\u683c\u5728{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$0{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u548c{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$15{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u4e4b\u95f4",
        "{c r=0.6 g=0.6 b=0.7}(Triggers {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}%{triggerName}{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} on everything {lootplot:INFO_COLOR}%{skipCount} times{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}!)": "\"{c r=0.6 g=0.6 b=0.7}(\u89e6\u53d1 {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}%{triggerName}{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} \u5728{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}%{skipCount}\u6b21{/lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\u7684\u6240\u6709\u7269\u54c1\u4e0a!)\"",
        "Spawns a %{RARE} item, and gives it {lootplot:GRUB_COLOR_LIGHT}GRUB-10{/lootplot:GRUB_COLOR_LIGHT}.": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a%{RARE}\u7269\u54c1\uff0c\u5e76\u8d4b\u4e88{lootplot:GRUB_COLOR_LIGHT}GRUB-10{/lootplot:GRUB_COLOR_LIGHT}\u3002",
        "Gives {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Destroy{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} trigger and {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Rotate{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} to items.": "\u7ed9\u4e88\u7269\u54c1{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u6467\u6bc1{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u89e6\u53d1\u548c{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65cb\u8f6c{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u3002",
        "When Rerolled, gain {lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+0.2 mult": "\u91cd\u63b7\u65f6\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}+0.2\u500d\u7387{/lootplot:POINTS_MULT_COLOR}",
        "All slots without {lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}DOOMED{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT} are given {lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}DOOMED-25{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}": "\u6240\u6709\u6ca1\u6709{lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}\u6ce8\u5b9a{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}\u7684\u69fd\u4f1a\u88ab\u8d4b\u4e88{lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}\u6ce8\u5b9a-25{/lootplot:DOOMED_COLOR_LIGHT}",
        "Earn {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} of interest for every {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} you have. (Max of {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$4{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR})": "\u62e5\u6709\u6bcf{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\uff0c\u8d5a\u53d6{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u7684\u5229\u606f\u3002\uff08\u6700\u591a\u4e3a{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$4{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\uff09",
        "Spawns a {c r=0.6 b=0.95 g=1}Diamond{/c} {lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}STICKY{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR} Slot": "\u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{c r=0.6 b=0.95 g=1}\u94bb\u77f3{/c}{lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}\u9ecf\u6027{/lootplot:STUCK_COLOR}\u69fd",
        "All items without {lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}DOOMED{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR} are given {lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}DOOMED-40{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}": "\u6240\u6709\u4e0d\u5177\u5907{lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u7684\u7269\u54c1\u5c06\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a-40{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}",
        "Randomizes item prices between {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}-$5{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} and {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}": "\"\u5c06\u7269\u54c1\u4ef7\u683c\u968f\u673a\u5316\u5728 {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}-$5{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} \u548c {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$20{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} \u4e4b\u95f4\"",
        "If {lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}bonus{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR} is negative, buffs items points equal to the {lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}negative bonus.{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}": "\u5982\u679c{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u52a0\u6210{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u4e3a\u8d1f\u503c\uff0c\u5219\u63d0\u5347\u7269\u54c1\u70b9\u6570\u7b49\u4e8e{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u8d1f\u52a0\u6210\u3002{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}",
        "If {lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}Bonus{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR} is negative, earn {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}money{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR} equal to the negative {lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}bonus.{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR} (Capped at $%{max}!)": "\u5982\u679c{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u52a0\u6210{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u4e3a\u8d1f\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97\u4e0e\u8d1f{lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u52a0\u6210{/lootplot:BONUS_COLOR}\u76f8\u7b49\u7684{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\u91d1\u94b1\u3002\uff08\u4e0a\u9650\u4e3a $%{max}\uff01\uff09",
        "When 3 are in a line:\nSpawns a {lootplot:INFO_COLOR}Cloud Food Item": "\u5f53\u4e09\u4e2a\u6210\u4e00\u6392\u65f6\uff1a \u751f\u6210\u4e00\u4e2a{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}\u4e91\u98df\u7269\u7269\u54c1{lootplot:INFO_COLOR}",
        "Transforms into slot that {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulses{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} items when {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Rerolled{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}": "\u53d8\u6210\u5728{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u91cd\u63b7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\u5bf9\u7269\u54c1\u4ea7\u751f{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u7684\u69fd",
        "Triggers {/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Level-Up{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR} on items": "\u5728\u7269\u54c1\u4e0a\u89e6\u53d1[1]\u5347\u7ea7{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}",
        "All slots without {lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}DOOMED{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR} are given {lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}DOOMED-25{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}": "\u6240\u6709\u6ca1\u6709{lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u7684\u69fd\u5c06\u53d8\u4e3a{lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u6ce8\u5b9a-25{/lootplot:DOOMED_LIGHT_COLOR}\u3002",
        "When {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Pulsed{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}, earn {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}\nWhen {lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}Rerolled{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}, lose {lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1": "\u89e6\u53d1{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u8109\u51b2{/lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1{/lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}  \n\u91cd\u63b7{lootplot:TRIGGER_COLOR}\u65f6\uff0c\u5931\u53bb{lootplot:MONEY_COLOR}$1",
        "Permanently buffs item/slots points by {lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+10": "\u6c38\u4e45\u589e\u52a0\u7269\u54c1/\u69fd\u70b9\u6570{lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+10",
        "When rotated, gain {lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+5 points": "\u65cb\u8f6c\u65f6\uff0c\u83b7\u5f97{lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}+5\u70b9\u6570{/lootplot:POINTS_COLOR}",
